 "notes": "A three-storey terraced house, 40 metres wide with a 12 metre back garden; 40 by 28 in all. Downstairs: the living room to the west, the hall with the main stairs, the kitchen and dining room to the east, and out the back the garden and the workshop at its end. Upstairs (floor 3 m): the bedroom, landing, bathroom, kids' room and study; a back stair climbs from the kitchen to the kids' room. The attic (floor 6 m) spans the whole house and is reached from the landing and the bedroom. X is east, Z is north, in metres; yaw is degrees clockwise from north; furniture 'y' is height above the room floor. Rooms marked outdoor have no ceiling and a garden or paved floor.",
